!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Cells were lysed and RNA was purified using Quick-RNA Microprep kit (Zymo Research) without the optional in-well DNase treatment step. Purified RNA was treated with TURBO DNase (Thermofisher Scientific) to remove potential contaminating DNA. RNA was subsequently purified using RNA Clean & Concentrator-5 kit (Zymo Research). RNA quality control was performed using an RNA ScreenTape assay (Agilent), with all samples having a RNA integrity number > 7.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA-seq libraries were prepared using the Illumina Stranded mRNA Prep kit, with 100ng of input RNA, following manufacturer's recommended protocol.
!Sample_data_processing = Adapters were trimmed from fastq files using cutadapt version 2.10 with default settings keeping a minimum read length of 20 bp.
!Sample_data_processing = Reads were mapped to the human genome GRCh38 keeping only uniquely mapping reads using STAR version 2.7.5b with the following settings “--outFilterMultimapNmax 1”.
!Sample_data_processing = Reads overlapping genes were then counted using featureCounts version 2.0.1 with the following settings “-s 2” and using the Gencode version 35 basic transcriptome annotation.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: GRCh38
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Matrix table with raw gene counts for every gene and every sample
